41. Critical End-to-End UI Workflows
41.1 Pending ITR
Compliance identifies pending cycle → filtered ITR register → user selects clients → bulk personalized outreach → client reply/documents appear in Communication Hub → attachments captured/linked → ITR Matter → task/checklist processing → review → completion/filing status → time/billing → reports.
41.2 Monthly GST
Cycle generated → documents pending → monthly client segment → reminder → documents received → GST matter → checklist → review → completion.
41.3 Regulatory Notice
Notice registered → deadline appears in Calendar/Dashboard → staff assigned → evidence collection → response drafting → review → submission record → closure/history.
41.4 Client Communication Request
Email/WhatsApp request → client identified → convert to task → existing/new matter selected → assignee/priority/due date → work completed → completion linked back to original communication.
41.5 Document Capture
Incoming attachment → communication record → identify client → select/identify matter → capture document → classify/metadata → available in client and matter document tabs → optionally request review/use as evidence.
