47. Final Acceptance Criteria for UI
A new user can understand the product hierarchy from navigation alone.
A user can move from a Client to active Matters, Tasks, Documents and Communications without searching manually.
Every operational dashboard number drills into a useful list.
Every list has search/filter/action capability appropriate to the module.
Every detail page clearly shows status, owner, due date, linked parent and next action.
ITR/GST/TDS/MCA workflows visually support segmentation, pending information, outreach, processing, review and completion.
Communication and received documents can be visually connected to the correct Client and Matter.
Review workflows show stage, reviewer actions and history.
